  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Annual voluntary core contributions to the Commonwealth of Learning 2021-22 to 2023-24</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consistent with Commonwealth member governments&#x2019; Memorandum of Under-standing establishing the Commonwealth of Learning (CoL), Australia has committed to providing annual voluntary core contributions to CoL. This multi-year funding arrangement supports CoL&#x2019;s activities in enhancing access to secondary and tertiary education across the Commonwealth.</narrative>
